Today, I learned the important concepts and formulas of Boats and Streams in Quantitative Aptitude.

## 📚 Concepts Covered
- Downstream
- Upstream
- Speed of boat in still water
- Speed of stream
- Time, Speed and Distance

## 📌 Important Formulas

1. Downstream Speed = Boat Speed + Stream Speed

2. Upstream Speed = Boat Speed − Stream Speed

3. Speed of Boat in Still Water =
   (Downstream Speed + Upstream Speed) / 2

4. Speed of Stream =
   (Downstream Speed − Upstream Speed) / 2

5. Speed = Distance / Time

6. Distance = Speed × Time

7. Time = Distance / Speed

